{"4206180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Freak Accident", "steam_appid": 4206180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAPPED IN THE HOUSE OF A SERIAL KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/bb873df1c46598e687aaf080f8eb92c5.avif?t=1777503013\" width=838 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a car accident, you and your girlfriend, Mary are held captive by a serial killer. You are trapped in a house that has every door chained and every window boarded up. All that matters is to find Mary and to get far away from this house of horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY SILENT AND HIDDEN TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/7e71f91f2f0b18c501e5522d0e98c69f.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/7e71f91f2f0b18c501e5522d0e98c69f.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move you make and everything you interact with creates noise. Raising the sound meter too high will lessen your chance of survival. Stay in the shadows and hide in closets, under beds or behind furniture. The killer’s sight is not as keen as his hearing, but he can still see in well lit areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND COLLECT ITEMS TO UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/5c7f6175e11953b6193a6a7eeb301d5d.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/5c7f6175e11953b6193a6a7eeb301d5d.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of what happened to the family who lived in the house and on the farm. Learn what caused a nice young family to fall victim to tragic events.  Piece together the story through the many interactive objects that give light to the secrets of the killer’s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE GIRL AND FIND A WAY TO ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/1015478cfbf8cf8b7b5c5184f83a1ae1.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/1015478cfbf8cf8b7b5c5184f83a1ae1.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is finding and rescuing Mary. Her life depends on you. Find her before it is too late. To make your escape with Mary, you will need to find tools, equipment and keys that allow you to get through blocked areas. Search everywhere for what might become useful for your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAPPED IN THE HOUSE OF A SERIAL KILLER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/bb873df1c46598e687aaf080f8eb92c5.avif?t=1777503013\" width=838 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a car accident, you and your girlfriend, Mary are held captive by a serial killer. You are trapped in a house that has every door chained and every window boarded up. All that matters is to find Mary and to get far away from this house of horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY SILENT AND HIDDEN TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/7e71f91f2f0b18c501e5522d0e98c69f.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/7e71f91f2f0b18c501e5522d0e98c69f.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move you make and everything you interact with creates noise. Raising the sound meter too high will lessen your chance of survival. Stay in the shadows and hide in closets, under beds or behind furniture. The killer’s sight is not as keen as his hearing, but he can still see in well lit areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND COLLECT ITEMS TO UNCOVER THE MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/5c7f6175e11953b6193a6a7eeb301d5d.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=247 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/5c7f6175e11953b6193a6a7eeb301d5d.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of what happened to the family who lived in the house and on the farm. Learn what caused a nice young family to fall victim to tragic events.  Piece together the story through the many interactive objects that give light to the secrets of the killer’s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SAVE THE GIRL AND FIND A WAY TO ESCAPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/1015478cfbf8cf8b7b5c5184f83a1ae1.poster.avif?t=1777503013\" width=440 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/extras/1015478cfbf8cf8b7b5c5184f83a1ae1.webm?t=1777503013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective is finding and rescuing Mary. Her life depends on you. Find her before it is too late. To make your escape with Mary, you will need to find tools, equipment and keys that allow you to get through blocked areas. Search everywhere for what might become useful for your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Freak Accident is a first-person survival horror game. Stay silent and hidden to escape a violent serial killer. Explore to uncover the mystery behind a killer’s past and the tragic events that fell on his family. Find clues and items to escape an intense nightmare of being hunted by a psychopath.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/642ddea9d44e01c168809eb13051ff94def226d5/header.jpg?t=1777503013", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206180/871966e31def177b68f02ede0a003219e344